      "writtenOn": "2022-12-20T10:52:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`reg_id` is only used for registration, which is a not supposed to be used by user even adv_sets is actually indexed by `reg_id`. You can iterate adv_sets and find a one with matched \u0027adv_id\u0027 which is a valid advertising set to be used.\nYou might use a filter adapter while iterating adv_sets or manage the mapping in other ways.",
